t nowcasting applications, extending short-term warning capability for strong rain.", "system_names": ["AI-Nowcast"], "techniques": ["ai_weather_model", "ml_dl"], "title": "WeatherNews implements AI-Nowcast to forecast heavy rain up to 3 hours ahead", "value_added": "Provides AI-based forecasts of heavy rain up to 3 hours ahead (nowcasting).", "value_types": ["accuracy", "lead_time"], "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(8,'','forecasting','2026-10-17T08:57:22Z','2026-10-22T03:04:51Z','2026-10-16','{"areas": ["forecasting", "warnings"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-17T08:48:44Z", "id": 8, "institution_types": ["private_sector"], "institutions": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Weathernews Inc.", "short_name": "Weathernews", "type": "private_sector"}], "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-22T03:04:51Z", "news_type": "other", "news_types": ["other"], "primary_area": "forecasting", "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T08:48:38Z", "source_name": "weathernews.jp", "title": "台風30号 AI予測は西寄り 物理モデルもAI予測に近づく傾向 - ウェザーニュース", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 AI forecast leans west; physical models also trending toward AI forecasts - Weathernews", "url": "https://weathernews.jp/news/202610/160151/"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-20T03:04:44Z", "source_name": "weathernews.jp", "title": "台風30号 物理モデルとAI予測に大きな差 AIモデルは北東へ転向する計算も - ウェザーニュース", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30: large difference between physical model and AI forecasts; AI model calculates turn to the northeast", "url": "https://weathernews.jp/news/202610/190101/"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "台風30号の進路について、従来の物理モデルとAI予測モデルで傾向に違いが見られ、物理モデルもAI予測に近づく傾向があると伝えられています。ウェザーニューズは進路予測を最大10日先まで延長したとしています。"}, "summary_en": "Weathernews reports that the track forecast for Typhoon No. 30 differs between conventional physical models and AI forecast models, with physical models increasingly resembling AI predictions. The company says it has extended its typhoon track forecasts to as far as 10 days ahead.", "system_names": [], "techniques": ["ai_weather_model"], "title": "Typhoon No. 30 AI forecast leans west; physical models also trending toward AI forecasts - Weathernews", "value_added": "Extends typhoon track forecasts out to up to 10 days ahead, as stated by the company.", "value_types": ["accuracy", "lead_time"], "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(9,'','forecasting','2026-10-17T08:57:22Z','2026-10-23T03:05:32Z','2026-10-16','{"areas": ["forecasting", "guidance", "communication"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-17T08:48:44Z", "id": 9, "institution_types": ["NMHS", "WMO_centre"], "institutions": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency", "short_name": "JMA", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": null, "name": "European Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts", "short_name": "ECMWF", "type": "WMO_centre"}], "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-23T03:05:32Z", "news_type": "pilot_research", "news_types": ["other", "pilot_research"], "primary_area": "forecasting", "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T08:48:38Z", "source_name": "kka-ai.com", "title": "AIで天気予報はどう変わる?|気象庁と海外のAI気象モデル、ゲリラ雷雨の捉え方、AIに天気を聞くときの注意 - AI・DXお役立ちサイト", "title_en": "How AI will change weather forecasting? JMA and overseas AI weather models, capturing guerrilla thunderstorms, and cautions when asking AI about weather", "url": "https://www.kka-ai.com/ai-weather-forecast/"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-22T03:05:25Z", "source_name": "news.yahoo.co.jp", "title": "台風30号の進路予想で試される従来予想モデルとAIの実力 欧米ではすでにAI予想も 日本は未導入（FNNプライムオンライン（フジテレビ系）） - Yahoo!ニュース", "title_en": "Traditional forecast models vs AI in predicting the track of Typhoon No. 30; Europe and US already operate AI forecasts, Japan has not yet introduced them", "url": "https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/1e67a84e097942d3fae4192ea4c31d54e5e02e87"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "欧米の気象機関はAIを使った気象予報モデルを運用しており、2026年に日本に接近した台風の進路予想では、従来モデルよりAIの方が比較的良好だったとの評価が紹介されている。日本は未導入とされる。"}, "summary_en": "The article reports that Western weather agencies already operate AI-based weather forecast models, and that for a 2026 typhoon approaching Japan, AI track forecasts were rated relatively better than conventional models. Japan has not yet introduced AI forecasting in its operations, according to the article.", "system_names": [], "techniques": ["ai_weather_model", "llm_genai"], "title": "Traditional forecast models vs AI in predicting the track of Typhoon No. 30; Europe and US already operate AI forecasts, Japan has not yet introduced them", "value_added": "AI-based models showed relatively better track forecast performance than conventional models for a typhoon approaching Japan in 2026, according to an evaluation cited in the article.", "value_types": ["accuracy"], "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
